Jobs1Recommended jobsNVitesApplication status2 UpdatesSaved jobsCompaniesExplore categoriesUnicornMNCStartupProduct basedInternetExplore collectionsTop companiesIT companiesFintech companiesSponsored companiesFeatured companiesResearch companies by AmbitionboxInterview questionsCompany salariesCompany reviewsSalary CalculatorServices1Resume writingText resumeVisual resumeResume critiqueFind JobsJobs4uPriority applicantContact usGet recruiter's attentionResume displayMonthly subscriptionsBasic & premium plansFree resume resourcesResume makerResume quality scoreResume samplesJob letter samplesPromotional OfferFASTJOB20 20% off on services to help get more callbacks1 OfferSearch jobs hereNeo-AI Job AgentNaukri ProResume ProResume Writing ServiceInterview Pro1{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"JobPosting","title":"Head Marketing - Animal Health - Aqua/Pet/Cattle/Poultry - Mumbai.","description":"<p><strong>Job description</strong></p><p><strong>Roles and Responsibilities:</strong></p><p><strong>1. Candidate will be working for reputed company in Veterinary / Animal Healthcare Business based at Mumbai/ Navi Mumbai office will be responsible for handling marketing function of Pet/ Aqua/Cattle/Dairy/ livestock /Poultry Segment.</strong></p><p><strong>2. He/she will be responsible for launching new products & strengthening the existing brands.</strong></p><p><strong>3. He/ She should have good knowledge in all Segments.</strong></p><p><strong>4. He/she will closely work with field Managers and all other supporters frequently.</strong></p><p><strong>5. He/she will prepare & implement promotional strategies & should be Creative.</strong></p><p><strong>6. He/she will design Promotional / communication strategies for the various brands of the</strong></p><p><strong>organization.</strong></p><p><strong>7. He/she will be responsible for customers oriented campaign & special activities for priority</strong></p><p><strong>products.</strong></p><p><strong>8. He/she will be responsible for Campaign & special activities planning for Key Opinion Leaders.</strong></p><p><strong>9. He/she will be responsible for Monthly / Quarterly brand review & monitoring.</strong></p><p><strong>10. He/she will responsible for Field work to review and evaluate strategy implementation .</strong></p><p><strong>Candidate will Co-ordinate with all support function for effective implementation of marketing</strong></p><p><strong>strategy.</strong></p><br /><p><strong>Desired Candidate Profile :</strong></p><p><strong>1. B.V. SC and AH Or M.V. SC, with MBA in Marketing with 15-18 yrs in Marketing of Veterinary Products covering all segments including Pet/Aqua /Cattle/Dairy/ livestock /Poultry and companion Animal and all kind of products.</strong></p><p><strong>2. He/she should have experience in launching New Products in all Segments.</strong></p><p><strong>3. He/ She should be good in launching new products and strengthening existing brands.</strong></p><p><strong>4. He/She should be exceptionally well organized with a track record that demonstrates self-</strong></p><p><strong>motivation, creativity and initiatives to achieve both personal and corporate goals.</strong></p><p><strong>5. Candidate should be excellent in communication.</strong></p><br /><p> Thanks & Regards,</p><p>Saili Panchal</p><p>HRD House - Mumbai</p><p>(Div Pharma Talent Search) </p><p>Mulund (East), Mumbai-400081.</p><p>Mobile Number : 9167799740</p><p>Mail I'd :- saili@hrdhouse.com</p><p>Website: - www.hrdhouse.com</p><br />","identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"HRD House","value":"070826035670"},"datePosted":"2026-08-07","validThrough":"2026-11-05","qualifications":{"@type":"EducationalOccupationalCredential","educationalLevel":"BVSC - Bachelor of Veterinary Science in Any Specialization, MVSC in Any Specialization"},"experienceRequirements":{"@type":"OccupationalExperienceRequirements","monthsOfExperience":"144"},"occupationalCategory":"Other","responsibilities":"Other","industry":"Pharmaceutical & Life Sciences","skills":["Product Marketing","Product Strategy","Product Management","Cattle","Dairy","Livestock","Veterinary","Product Launch"],"specialCommitments":"-","workHours":"9am-6pm","employmentType":"Full Time, Permanent","hiringOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"HRD House","sameAs":"HRD House","logo":"https://img.naukimg.com/logo_images/groups/v1/361794.gif"},"jobLocation":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":["Mumbai"],"addressRegion":["Mumbai"],"postalCode":"-","streetAddress":["-"],"addressCountry":"-"}},"baseSalary":{"@type":"MonetaryAmount","currency":"INR","value":{"@type":"QuantitativeValue","value":"25-35 Lacs P.A ","unitText":"P.A."}}}{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@id":"https://www.naukri.com","name":"Home"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@id":"https://www.naukri.com/jobs-in-mumbai","name":"Jobs in Mumbai"}}]}Head Marketing - Animal Health - Aqua/Pet/Cattle/Poultry - Mumbai.HRD HousePosted by HRD HouseFeatured staffing consultancy12 - 15 years25-35 Lacs P.A. MumbaiSend me jobs like thisPosted: 3 days agoOpenings: 1Applicants: 46SaveApplyHead Marketing - Animal Health - Aqua/Pet/Cattle/Poultry - Mumbai.HRD HousePosted by HRD HouseSend me jobs like thisApplyJob highlightsB.V.SC and AH or M.V.SC with MBA in Marketing and 15-18 years in veterinary product marketing including Pet/Aqua/Cattle/Dairy/Livestock/Poultry segmentsLaunch new products, strengthen brands, design and implement promotional strategies, coordinate with field managers and support functions, conduct brand reviews and field evaluationsJob match scoreEarly ApplicantKeyskillsLocationWork ExperienceJob descriptionJob descriptionRoles and Responsibilities:1. Candidate will be working for reputed company in Veterinary / Animal Healthcare Business based at Mumbai/ Navi Mumbai office will be responsible for handling marketing function of Pet/ Aqua/Cattle/Dairy/ livestock /Poultry Segment.2. He/she will be responsible for launching new products & strengthening the existing brands.3. He/ She should have good knowledge in all Segments.4. He/she will closely work with field Managers and all other supporters frequently.5. He/she will prepare & implement promotional strategies & should be Creative.6. He/she will design Promotional / communication strategies for the various brands of theorganization.7. He/she will be responsible for customers oriented campaign & special activities for priorityproducts.8. He/she will be responsible for Campaign & special activities planning for Key Opinion Leaders.9. He/she will be responsible for Monthly / Quarterly brand review & monitoring.10. He/she will responsible for Field work to review and evaluate strategy implementation .Candidate will Co-ordinate with all support function for effective implementation of marketingstrategy.Desired Candidate Profile :1. B.V. SC and AH Or M.V. SC, with MBA in Marketing with 15-18 yrs in Marketing of Veterinary Products covering all segments including Pet/Aqua /Cattle/Dairy/ livestock /Poultry and companion Animal and all kind of products.2. He/she should have experience in launching New Products in all Segments.3. He/ She should be good in launching new products and strengthening existing brands.4. He/She should be exceptionally well organized with a track record that demonstrates self-motivation, creativity and initiatives to achieve both personal and corporate goals.5. Candidate should be excellent in communication. Thanks & Regards,Saili PanchalHRD House - Mumbai(Div Pharma Talent Search) Mulund (East), Mumbai-400081.Mobile Number : 9167799740Mail I'd :- saili@hrdhouse.comWebsite: - www.hrdhouse.comRole: Other,Industry Type: Pharmaceutical & Life Sciences,Department: Other,Employment Type: Full Time, PermanentRole Category: OtherEducationUG: BVSC - Bachelor of Veterinary Science in Any SpecializationPG: MVSC in Any Spec