ofile</strong></p><ul><li>6-12 years of experience in Business Development, Corporate Leasing, Commercial Real Estate, Workplace Consulting, IPC, Interior Fit-Out, or Design & Build industry. </li><li>Proven experience in generating and closing B2B business opportunities within the corporate interiors or commercial real estate sector. </li><li>Strong network and working relationships with International Property Consultants (IPCs), developers, PMCs, architects, consultants, and corporate occupiers. </li><li>Sound understanding of commercial leasing, workplace solutions, office fit-out projects, and corporate real estate dynamics. </li><li>Demonstrated ability to identify business opportunities and convert leads into successful project wins. </li><li>Excellent communication, presentation, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills. </li><li>Strong client-facing and relationship-building capabilities with a consultative sales approach. </li><li>Ability to manage multiple clients, opportunities, and sales cycles simultaneously. </li><li>Highly self-motivated, target-driven, and capable of working in a fast-paced environment. </li><li>Candidates from IPCs, commercial real estate consulting firms, Design & Build companies, Interior Fit-Out organizations, workplace consulting firms, or commercial property developers will be preferred.</li></ul><br /><p><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></p><ul><li>Bachelor's Degree in Business Administration, Marketing, Real Estate, Architecture, Interior Design, or a related field. </li><li>MBA in Marketing, Sales, Business Development, or Real Estate Management will be preferred.<br /> </li></ul><p><strong>Preferred Industry Background:</strong> Design & Build, Interior Fit-Out, Commercial Real Estate, Corporate Leasing, Workplace Consulting, International Property Consultants (IPC), Project Management Consulting Firms, and Commercial Property Developers.</p><br /><p><strong>Compensation:</strong> Competitive Salary + Perks+ 