portunities, and sales cycles simultaneously. Highly self-motivated, target-driven, and capable of working in a fast-paced environment. Candidates from IPCs, commercial real estate consulting firms, Design & Build companies, Interior Fit-Out organizations, workplace consulting firms, or commercial property developers will be preferred.Educational QualificationBachelor's Degree in Business Administration, Marketing, Real Estate, Architecture, Interior Design, or a related field. MBA in Marketing, Sales, Business Development, or Real Estate Management will be preferred. Preferred Industry Background: Design & Build, Interior Fit-Out, Commercial Real Estate, Corporate Leasing, Workplace Consulting, International Property Consultants (IPC), Project Management Consulting Firms, and Commercial Property Developers.Compensation: Competitive Salary + Perks+ Career Growth Opportunities.Role: Architecture & Interior Design - Other,Industry Type: Architecture / Interior Design,Department: UX, Design & Architecture,Employment Type: Full Time, PermanentRole Category: Architecture & Interior DesignEducationUG: Any GraduatePG: MBA/PGDM in Any Specialization, Any PostgraduateKey SkillsSkills highlighted with ‘‘ are preferred keyskillsFit outInterior DesigningInterior FinishingTurnkey Project ManagementCorporate InteriorsSalesProject ManagementPMCCommercial ProjectsBusiness DevelopmentInterior WorksTurnkey ProjectsReport this jobAbout companyInnovatione India Project LLP is a leading interior fit-out and design-build organization specializing in turnkey solutions for corporate offices, commercial spaces, and premium workspaces. With a strong focus on quality, innovation, and timely delivery, we offer end-to-end services including design, project management, execution, and post-delivery support. Our team of experienced professionals has successfully delivered projects for top multinational companies, leading developers, and fast-growing enterprises across India.Company InfoAddress:Bui