ker’ award for developing and deploying the country’s first round-the-clock power project. ReNew’s solar and wind energy projects currently contribute to 1.9% of India’s power capacity and are spread across 150+ sites and 18 Indian states. We have helped prevent 0.5% of India’s total carbon emissions and 1.1% of India’s total power sector emissions, in addition to generating around 130,000 jobs over the past decade.</p> </div> </div> <div> <div> Job Description </div> <div> <p><strong>Roles and Responsibilities:</strong></p> <ol> <li><strong>CFO & Leadership Support:</strong></li> </ol> <ul> <li>Act as an execution support partner on key initiatives, reviews, and projects.</li> <li>Prepare briefing notes, presentations, and executive summaries.</li> <li>Coordinate leadership meetings, follow up on action items, and track deliverables.</li> <li>Liaise with internal stakeholders, consultants, and advisors.</li> <li>Act as a trusted interface between the CFO office and other departments.</li> </ul> <ol> <li><strong>Financial Analysis: </strong></li> </ol> <ul> <li>Assist in scenario modelling, sensitivity analysis, and decisionsupport analytics.</li> <li>Analyze performance across business units, identify key trends, variances, and drivers, and provide actionable insights.</li> <li>Coordinate with business, finance, and accounting teams to resolve data gaps and clarifications.</li> <li>Prepare dashboards, MIS reports, and presentations as required.</li> </ul> <ol> <li><strong>Business Performance & Insights:</strong></li> </ol> <ul> <li>Partner with business and functional leaders to provide financial insights and recommendations.</li> <li>Monitor KPIs, margins, cost structures, and working capital metrics.</li> </ul> <ol> <li><strong>Process Improvement & Projects</strong></li> </ol> <ul> <li>Drive and support finance transformation, automation, standardization, and continuous improvement of finance processes (including CFO Office)</li> <li>Coordinate crossfunctional 